# Negative test for LOF-ODP-001 0.3.0 (proposed). A void act cannot establish legal content:
# 'establishes' has domain legal act, and void act is disjoint from legal act.
# Expected: INCONSISTENT under both ODP-003 options.
@prefix ex:  <https://example.org/lease/> .
@prefix lof: <https://w3id.org/lof/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/lof/examples/nullity-negative-test.ttl> a owl:Ontology .
ex:danNotice lof:ODP001_0001100 ex:danNoticeText .
